#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**SWAP gate**\n"
msgstr "**Gate SWAP**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The SWAP gate swaps the states of two qubits.\n"
msgstr "O gate SWAP troca os estados de dois qubits.\n"

