#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The RX gate implements $exp(-i\\frac{\\theta}{2}X)$. On the Bloch sphere, "
"this gate corresponds to rotating the qubit state around the x axis by the "
"given angle.\n"
msgstr ""
"O gate RX implementa $exp(-i\\frac{\\theta}{2}X)$. Na esfera de Bloch, esse "
"gate corresponde a rotacionar o estado do qubit em torno do eixo x pelo "
"ângulo fornecido.\n"

