#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The RY gate implements $exp(-i\\frac{\\theta}{2}Y)$. On the Bloch sphere, "
"this gate corresponds to rotating the qubit state around the y axis by the "
"given angle and does not introduce complex amplitudes.\n"
msgstr ""
"O gate RY implementa $exp(-i\\frac{\\theta}{2}Y)$. Na esfera de Bloch, esse "
"gate corresponde a rotacionar o estado do qubit em torno do eixo y pelo "
"ângulo fornecido e não introduz amplitudes complexas.\n"

